# Code Style

- Comments in English only
- Prefer functional programming over OOP
- Use classes only for external clients/connectors; app logic stays functional
- Write pure functions; never mutate inputs or global state
- Make minimal, focused edits; follow DRY, KISS, YAGNI
- Reuse existing logic; search before writing new code
- Match existing file naming and folder conventions

## React/Next
- Use modern React (19) patterns; avoid unnecessary state and effects
- Keep components small, typed, and colocate related UI under `src/components`
- For UI primitives, place in `src/components/ui` (shadcn-style)
- Respect the `@` alias → `./src/*`

## Styling
- TailwindCSS (v3 currently). Prefer utility classes; avoid deep custom CSS
- Keep global CSS minimal in `src/app/globals.css`
